\newlabel{fig:cutaway}{{3}{7}{\textbf {The same encoder and statistic, only the views changed.} Each pair is a held-out build over its \solidify {} twin. \emph {Left:} two of the four exterior views the standard protocol renders, indistinguishable for this build at a mean pixel difference of $0.89/255$. \emph {Right:} three cutaway protocols on the same builds, each with its separation in noise floors. DINOv2-B, unbiased KID, $n{=}256$ against $512$ reference builds; full ablation in Table~\ref {tab:ablation}}{figure.3}{}}
