\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The geometric descriptor.} A $2\times 2\times 2$ occupancy neighborhood, its orbit under the order-$8$ group of yaw rotations and an $x$-mirror collapsing to one canonical bin, and the resulting feature vector with the shift \mbox  {\textsc  {Fill-Interior}}{} induces. The thickness histogram loses its one-block walls and gains thick cores, and surface-to-volume with both interior ratios falls. Filling every sealed interior moves this descriptor $202$ noise floors at $n{=}128$, where the same builds move the render tier $0.4$.}}{31}{figure.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:descriptor}{{14}{31}{\textbf {The geometric descriptor.} A $2\times 2\times 2$ occupancy neighborhood, its orbit under the order-$8$ group of yaw rotations and an $x$-mirror collapsing to one canonical bin, and the resulting feature vector with the shift \solidify {} induces. The thickness histogram loses its one-block walls and gains thick cores, and surface-to-volume with both interior ratios falls. Filling every sealed interior moves this descriptor $202$ noise floors at $n{=}128$, where the same builds move the render tier $0.4$}{figure.14}{}}
